Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:07.110 align:start position:0%
 
[Music]  today we are adopting the eu disability  rights strategy  for 2021-2013  this strategy lays out our plan to  implement the un convention on the  rights of persons with disabilities  until 2030.  the new eu disability rights strategy  provides  a strong framework to ensure that  persons with disabilities  can participate equally in all areas of  life  our ambitions are high and change will  require  everyone's commitment we want to  guarantee that all persons with  disabilities in the eu  enjoy their human rights on an equal  basis with others  have equal access to participate in our  society  and economy are able to decide where  how and with whom they want to live can  move freely in the eu  regardless of their support needs and no  longer experience discrimination  of course we cannot do this alone we  will work  closely with national authorities  persons with disabilities will be part  of the dialogue  and the process we are stronger when all  our citizens  are valued and included i am committed  to delivering  a union of equality  you

